        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 24 at 11:29AM HST until September 26 at 6:00PM HST by NWS Honolulu HI</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northeast winds 25 to 30 kt and seas 9 to 14 feet.

* WHERE...Kauai Channel, Oahu Windward Waters and Oahu Leeward
Waters.

* WHEN...Until 6 PM HST Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in these conditions.</instruction>
